  "limits": "One instrumented run per revision on a shared host. Self weights are wall-time CPU samples, not calibrated CPU time. Zod totals sum the retained top-source rows, not every possible small source. Trace events overlap/nest and cannot be added across types. Diagnostic source-map builds have extra footer bytes and are not production artifacts. Lower schema/module work does not establish faster overall startup: sampled wall time rose in the second run with much more unattributed program time. No GDD/device acceptance inferred.",
